sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Employee App
    participant p1 as Location OS
    participant p2 as Attendance API
    participant p3 as Policy Engine
    participant p4 as Attendance DB
    participant p5 as Review Queue
    p0->>p1: Fresh GPS attempt #1
    p1->>p0: Weak or timed-out fix
    p0->>p1: Attempt #2 when appropriate
    p1->>p0: Best valid evidence or no fix
    p0->>p2: Submit status and evidence
    p2->>p3: Evaluate location switch, permission, mock status
    p3->>p2: Verified, unverified, or blocked
    p2->>p4: Store policy outcome and raw evidence
    p2->>p5: Flag uncertainty / outside-site reason
